---
args: {"offer": "SurplusOffer", "events": "Evidence[]"}
returns: "MaterialProfile"
---
Identify the evidence source for each material function, specification, condition, quantity and ownership claim. Record test conditions, serial/lot and maintenance history without generalizing to unrelated units. Distinguish a seller's belief from a verified certificate. Preserve transfer restrictions and require the actual owner's authority; do not infer clear title from physical possession.
